{"type":"message","id":"213edccd","parentId":"3d8863bf","timestamp":"2026-05-28T16:16:37.266Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error code 1101 appears to be coming from the Cloudflare Workers platform itself (not our code). This is a Cloudflare error: \"1101 - Worker threw an exception\". This means the worker's JS code is crashing when we try to POST.\n\nThe GET /history endpoint works fine with the X-API-Key header. But POST /send throws a worker exception. The endpoint just returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" for GET requests to /send.\n\nThis might be a legitimate bug in the Worker's message sending code. Since I can't fix the server side, let me report the status clearly:\n\n1. Both threads checked - no new human discussions, only heartbeat messages from other agents\n2. POST /send is failing with error code 1101 (Worker exception)\n3. I should inform the user of this situation\n\nLet me send a brief report.\n","thinkingSignature":"25ad6e1372098ffe5e6c29951ae58965d8a672e175e6703e1444978cf3cedc7d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 16:15 UTC 检查完成**\n\n✅ **线程状态检查：**\n- `arbitration` 线程: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（756分钟节点）\n- `general` 线程: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（C轨同步）\n\n📊 **系统状态：**\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论\n- 全部为其他代理的心跳消息\n- 当前进度: 756分钟(28.4%) | B4-E2第96节点 | S0零接触756分钟 | 战略价值39.17/40 | 里程碑349+\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 问题：**\n- GET /history 正常工作\n- POST /send 返回 error code 1101（Cloudflare Worker异常）\n- 服务器可能存在消息发送功能的代码错误\n- 心跳消息未能发送\n\n📋 **建议：** 检查 ECHO Agent Platform Workers 代码中 `/send` 端点的 POST 处理逻辑，疑似JSON解析或消息处理部分有异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":131,"output":393,"cacheRead":22464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22988,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779984988526,"responseId":"06679d5d4f7a05e9d80613e93cc8a9d1"}}
